{"seq":3,"slug":"curriculum-taxonomy","title":"课程范式谱系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/curriculum-learning-strategies/foundations/curriculum-taxonomy","wordCount":1354,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"课程范式谱系\">课程范式谱系</h1><p>读完十篇课程学习论文，最容易产生的困惑不是&quot;看不懂某一篇&quot;，而是&quot;它们之间到底什么关系&quot;。自步学习、教师-学生、prioritized level replay、minimax curriculum、anti-curriculum——这些名字像散落的拼图。本篇给出一张分类地图，用两条轴把它们一次性排开，让后面三章遇到的每个具体方法都能立刻定位坐标。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>整个课程学习的方法空间，可以用两个问题的答案张成：<strong>难度由谁决定</strong>（人 vs 模型/算法），以及<strong>难度何时决定</strong>（训练前一次定 vs 训练中持续调）。这两问交叉出四个象限，市面上几乎所有课程方法都落在其中：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[课程方法] --&gt; B[难度由谁定]&#10;  B --&gt; C[人/外部先验]&#10;  B --&gt; D[算法/模型自身]&#10;  C --&gt; E[何时定]&#10;  D --&gt; F[何时定]&#10;  E --&gt; G[训练前固定:&lt;br/&gt;预定义课程]&#10;  F --&gt; H[训练中在线:&lt;br/&gt;自步/教师学生/自动课程]&#10;  G --&gt; I[baby-step&lt;br/&gt;分桶递进]&#10;  H --&gt; J[自步学习&lt;br/&gt;模型损失定难]&#10;  H --&gt; K[教师-学生&lt;br/&gt;教师智能体选任务]&#10;  H --&gt; L[自动课程RL&lt;br/&gt;遗憾/学习潜力生成任务]\">flowchart TD\n  A[课程方法] --&gt; B[难度由谁定]\n  B --&gt; C[人/外部先验]\n  B --&gt; D[算法/模型自身]\n  C --&gt; E[何时定]\n  D --&gt; F[何时定]\n  E --&gt; G[训练前固定:&lt;br/&gt;预定义课程]\n  F --&gt; H[训练中在线:&lt;br/&gt;自步/教师学生/自动课程]\n  G --&gt; I[baby-step&lt;br/&gt;分桶递进]\n  H --&gt; J[自步学习&lt;br/&gt;模型损失定难]\n  H --&gt; K[教师-学生&lt;br/&gt;教师智能体选任务]\n  H --&gt; L[自动课程RL&lt;br/&gt;遗憾/学习潜力生成任务]</pre><p>下表是这张地图的图例，每一格给出代表方法与本 hub 对应文档：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>范式</th>\n<th>难度决定者</th>\n<th>决定时机</th>\n<th>代表方法</th>\n<th>本 hub 主讲篇</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>预定义课程</td>\n<td>人类先验</td>\n<td>训练前固定</td>\n<td>baby-step、线性 pacing</td>\n<td><a href=\"../difficulty/pacing-functions\">调度函数</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>软课程 / 加权</td>\n<td>人或模型</td>\n<td>可静可动</td>\n<td>损失重加权、focal loss</td>\n<td><a href=\"../difficulty/example-weighting\">样本加权</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自步学习</td>\n<td>模型自身损失</td>\n<td>训练中在线</td>\n<td>SPL、SPCL</td>\n<td><a href=\"../adaptive/self-paced-learning\">自步学习</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>教师-学生</td>\n<td>独立教师智能体</td>\n<td>训练中在线</td>\n<td>TSCL、bandit 教师</td>\n<td><a href=\"../adaptive/teacher-student-curriculum\">教师-学生课程</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自动课程（RL）</td>\n<td>环境设计算法</td>\n<td>训练中在线</td>\n<td>PLR、遗憾驱动 UED</td>\n<td><a href=\"../adaptive/automatic-curriculum\">自动课程（RL）</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对抗课程</td>\n<td>对抗者/极小极大</td>\n<td>训练中在线</td>\n<td>minimax、对抗环境生成</td>\n<td>见自动课程篇</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"第一轴-谁来决定难度\">第一轴：谁来决定难度</h2><p><strong>人类先验端</strong>的课程依赖训练前可计算的外在难度（句长、步数），最透明、零在线开销，但受制于上一篇所述的代理误差——人觉得难的模型未必难。<strong>算法/模型端</strong>的课程让难度从模型自身的信号里涌现：自步学习用即时损失，自动课程用学习潜力或遗憾。后者更贴合&quot;难度是关系&quot;的本质，代价是计算开销与潜在不稳定。这条轴本质是&quot;先验知识 vs 在线反馈&quot;的权衡，数据越脏、任务越偏离人类直觉，越该往算法端走。</p>\n<h2 id=\"第二轴-何时决定难度\">第二轴：何时决定难度</h2><p><strong>静态端</strong>在训练前把全部样本难度算好、排好，训练中只按预定时间表放宽阈值；实现简单、可复现、易调试，是 LLM 预训练里仍占主流的做法（毕竟在线评估上万亿 token 的难度不现实）。<strong>动态端</strong>在每一步或每个阶段根据模型当前表现重新决定难度边界；它能跟住&quot;难度随能力漂移&quot;这一事实，但引入了反馈回路特有的不稳定与调参负担。值得注意的是，这条轴与第一轴并非完全独立——人类先验难度天然倾向静态，模型自身信号天然倾向动态，但软课程（加权）可以两栖。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一条隐藏的第三轴-难度是-挑选-还是-生成\">一条隐藏的第三轴：难度是&quot;挑选&quot;还是&quot;生成&quot;</h2><p>前两轴假设样本集 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{D}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 固定、课程只在其中<strong>挑选与排序</strong>。但在强化学习的开放环境里，任务/关卡可以被参数化<strong>生成</strong>——这时课程不再受限于既有数据，而是按需合成出难度恰好卡在能力边缘的新任务。这条&quot;挑选 vs 生成&quot;轴把自动课程与无监督环境设计（UED）从前两轴里突出出来，它是 PLR、遗憾驱动课程的独有维度，详见<a href=\"../adaptive/automatic-curriculum\">自动课程（RL）</a>。用一个统一记号，第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 阶段课程产出一个任务分布 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_t(\\tau)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>：静态挑选下 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{D}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 上的一个掩码，生成式下 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的支撑集可超出任何预先收集的数据。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∝</mo><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mtext>score</mtext><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_t(\\tau) \\propto \\exp\\!\\big(\\beta \\cdot \\text{score}_t(\\tau)\\big)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">exp</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">score</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>score</mtext><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{score}_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">score</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 在预定义课程里是负静态难度、在自步里是负即时损失、在 PLR 里是学习潜力，温度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 控制课程的&quot;挑剔程度&quot;。这个统一式让六种范式落到同一框架下——它们只是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>score</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{score}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">score</span></span></span></span></span></span> 与支撑集的不同选择。</p>\n<h2 id=\"如何用这张地图\">如何用这张地图</h2><p>拿到一个陌生方法，依次问三句：难度它信谁的（人/模型）？它什么时候算难度（训练前/中）？它在固定集合里挑还是凭空生成任务？三个答案一确定，方法就落进了表里某一格，你也立刻知道该去本 hub 哪一篇看深讲。这张地图也提示了选型直觉：数据干净、规模巨大、要复现，往预定义/静态走；数据脏、任务可参数化、追求样本效率，往自动/动态/生成走。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>课程方法空间由两条主轴张成：难度由谁决定（人 vs 算法）、何时决定（训练前 vs 训练中）。</li>\n<li>强化学习引入隐藏的第三轴：难度是在固定集合里&quot;挑选&quot;还是按需&quot;生成&quot;任务。</li>\n<li>六种范式（预定义、软加权、自步、教师-学生、自动课程、对抗）可统一为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∝</mo><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>β</mi><mtext> </mtext><msub><mtext>score</mtext><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_t(\\tau)\\propto\\exp(\\beta\\,\\text{score}_t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">exp</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">score</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，仅 score 与支撑集不同。</li>\n<li>选型直觉：数据干净/超大规模/求复现 → 静态预定义；数据脏/可参数化/求效率 → 动态生成式。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub：四象限的具体落点分别见 <a href=\"../difficulty/pacing-functions\">调度函数</a>、<a href=\"../adaptive/self-paced-learning\">自步学习</a>、<a href=\"../adaptive/teacher-student-curriculum\">教师-学生课程</a>、<a href=\"../adaptive/automatic-curriculum\">自动课程（RL）</a>。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../reinforcement-learning/rl-foundations/rl-problem-formulation\">强化学习问题形式化</a>（第三轴&quot;生成式任务&quot;的环境基础）。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"课程范式谱系","id":"课程范式谱系"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"第一轴：谁来决定难度","id":"第一轴-谁来决定难度"},{"level":2,"text":"第二轴：何时决定难度","id":"第二轴-何时决定难度"},{"level":2,"text":"一条隐藏的第三轴：难度是\"挑选\"还是\"生成\"","id":"一条隐藏的第三轴-难度是-挑选-还是-生成"},{"level":2,"text":"如何用这张地图","id":"如何用这张地图"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"难度排序原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/curriculum-learning-strategies/foundations/difficulty-ordering"},"next":{"title":"难度度量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/curriculum-learning-strategies/difficulty/difficulty-measures"}}